.0,"unit":"%"}],"engraveRandom":[{"name":"攻击","unit":"%","values":[3.0,6.0,9.0,12.0,15.0]}],"effects":[{"name":"凝聚魔力","description":"神奇激光束连续3次命中目标，按照每秒伤害的35%，造成额外伤害，并附带僵化效果。"}],"skill":{"name":"威猛激光链","description":"发射威猛激光凝聚能，同时对诸多敌人造成伤害，并附带击倒效果。","levels":[2,5],"damage":[210.0,240.0],"cooldown":[9.3,9.0],"ailment":"击倒"}}],"number":1}],"profile":{"Age":[19],"Height":[162],"Weight":[50]},"tribes":["人类"],"story":"索菲，魔法学院高材生。\n\n虽没有任何魔法天赋，却擅长融合魔法与技术进行创新发明，施展名曰‘魔科学’的超凡魔法。\n\n聪明伶俐，但缺乏社交能力，不会分场合，经常口无遮拦地说出‘比我笨的你们’侮辱对方。不认识索菲的人还以为她品性恶劣，其实，索菲只是不懂得交际，分不清哪些话该说，哪些话不该讲，也不明白怎样才是为对方着想。喜欢指出别人的缺点，为他人讲解是想炫耀自己胜过旁人的能力，因此，越发难以与人相处。\n\n曾经向学院申请过组建《给魔法时报寄抗议信》社团，被学院领导拒绝。","storyKey":"profile_ghost_buster_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=41","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=41","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"],"voiceAudio":"gtaudio/data/offline-package.json; CharacterVoiceType; heroes.json VoiceId"},"voiceLines":[{"id":"ghost_buster","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["这些不能用作实验数据。"],"enUS":["This data isn't good enough."],"jaJP":["こんなの、実験データにすらならない"]},"keys":["cv_ghost_buster_NormalBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/41/410001@8615963518616198620"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/41/410001"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/41/410001@7428259610061654105"]},"audioName":"410001"},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["按计划行事。"],"enUS":["Just as calculated."],"jaJP":["計画通り"]},"keys":["cv_ghost_buster_BossBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/41/410002@-4960465456574379491"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/41/410002"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/41/410002@-4603293794911682835"]},